its pasturelands,, 


En-gannim with its pasturelands—four cities;

Helkath with 


its pasturelands,, 


and Rehob with its pasturelands—four cities;

Dimnah with 


its pasturelands,, 


Nahalal with its pasturelands—four cities;

Kedemoth with 


its pasturelands,, 


and Mephaath with its pasturelands—four cities;
